    "label": "36",
    "prompt": "Rationalise the denominator and simplify. $\\dfrac5{\\sqrt7-\\sqrt5}$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\dfrac52(\\sqrt7+\\sqrt5)$.\n\nMultiply numerator and denominator by the conjugate $\\sqrt7+\\sqrt5$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac5{\\sqrt7-\\sqrt5}&=\\frac5{\\sqrt7-\\sqrt5}\\times\\frac{\\sqrt7+\\sqrt5}{\\sqrt7+\\sqrt5}\\\\\\frac5{\\sqrt7-\\sqrt5}&=\\frac{5(\\sqrt7+\\sqrt5)}{7-5}\\\\\\frac5{\\sqrt7-\\sqrt5}&=\\frac52(\\sqrt7+\\sqrt5).\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
